'''Heat Jaws'''{{Refn|[[:File:Mutant (2438).png]]|group = credits}}<ref name="DAatMR"/> is the [[Combinations (Classic)|combination]] of [[Heatblast (Classic)|Heatblast]] and [[Ripjaws (Classic)|Ripjaws]]' DNA. He cannot be accessed unless the faceplate of the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] is broken or by using the [[Biomnitrix]].{{Refn|group = note|name = fusions|[[Diamond Matter]], Heat Jaws, and [[Stink Arms]] are three fusions which were originally created by a broken, [[Omnitrix (Original)|prototype Omnitrix]]. All three fusions are possible with the [[Biomnitrix]]. However, they might differ in aspects such as appearance, powers and weaknesses as there is no evidence that the broken prototype Omnitrix creates fusions the same way as the Biomnitrix.}}

==Appearance==
Heat Jaws has [[Ripjaws (Classic)|Ripjaws]]' torso, however his arms and legs are essentially [[Heatblast (Classic)|Heatblast]]'s. Also, the fin that Ripjaws usually has on his back is replaced with a line of fire. 

==Powers and Abilities==
<gallery type="slideshow" position="left">
Mutant (1612).png|Fire Resistance
Mutant (1675).png|Enhanced Strength
Mutant (1754).png|Enhanced Durability
Mutant (1784).png|Fire/Heat Amplification
Mutant (2042).png|Enhanced Bite/Sharp Teeth
Mutant (2084).png|Underwater Breathing
Mutant (2113).png|Underwater Heat Generation
Mutant (2241).png|Pyrokinesis
</gallery>
Being part-[[Pyronite (Classic)|Pyronite]], Heat Jaws possesses pyrokinesis similar to [[Heatblast (Classic)|Heatblast]]. Surprisingly, his flames actually get much stronger after Heat Jaws submerges himself in water.

Being part-[[Piscciss Volann (Classic)|Piscciss Volann]], Heat Jaws' sharp teeth and jaws are as powerful as [[Ripjaws (Classic)|Ripjaws']]. He can also breathe underwater.<ref name="DAatMR"/>

Heat Jaws has enhanced strength and durability and is resistant to fire attacks.

==Weaknesses==
[[File:Mutant (1805).png|thumb|Dehydration/Heat Exposure]]
Because his [[Piscciss Volann (Classic)|Piscciss Volann]] DNA needs water to live while his [[Pyronite (Classic)|Pyronite]] half generates enormous amount of heat, Heat Jaws quickly gets dehydrated on land. Heat Jaws needs much effort to use his pyrokinesis whether inside or out of water.<ref name="DAatMR"/>

==History==
===Ben 10===
*Heat Jaws first appeared in ''[[Dr. Animo and the Mutant Ray]]'', where he defeated [[Heatbat]], the [[Mutant Frog]] and [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo]], reverted [[Max Tennyson (Classic)|Max]] back to normal, and fixed the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]].

